{{if .reviewerform.certificate_id}}
### ✅ Phytosanitary Certificate Issued

The PQS/NPQS officer has issued your Phytosanitary Certificate.

* **Reference Number**: `{{.reference_number}}`
* **Certificate Number**: `{{.reviewerform.certificate_id}}`
{{if .reviewerform.certificate_url}}* **Certificate Document**: [Download Certificate]({{.reviewerform.certificate_url}}){{end}}
{{if .reviewerform.comments}}* **Officer Remarks**: {{.reviewerform.comments}}{{end}}
{{if .reviewerform.certificate_items}}
**Items On This Certificate:**
{{range .reviewerform.certificate_items}}* 🏷️ **{{.commodity_common_name}}** (`{{.id}}`) — {{if eq .include_in_certificate false}}❌ Not included{{else}}✅ Included{{end}}
{{end}}
{{end}}

{{if .ephyto_required}}Your certificate is now being submitted to the IPPC ePhyto Hub for electronic transmission to the importing country.{{else}}Your Phytosanitary Certificate has been issued. The export process is now complete.{{end}}
{{else}}
### ⏳ Phytosanitary Certificate Being Prepared

All requirements have been met and payment has been confirmed. The PQS/NPQS officer is now preparing and issuing your Phytosanitary Certificate.

* **Reference Number**: `{{.reference_number}}`
{{if .certificate_items}}
**Items Awaiting Certificate Issuance:**
{{range .certificate_items}}* 🏷️ **{{.commodity_common_name}}** (`{{.id}}`)
{{end}}
{{end}}

You will be notified once the certificate has been issued.
{{end}}
